  "notes": "Multiple greenhouse experiments. Exp 1: lettuce on Waimea Andisol, charcoal at 0/5/10/20% w/w +/- fertilizer, n=3. Exp 2: corn on Waimea Andisol, same rates, n=3. Exp 3: corn on Leilehua Ultisol with charcoal/lime/fertilizer, n=4. Exp 4: corn on Leilehua with high-VM vs low-VM charcoal, n=4. Outcome: shoot dry matter (g pot-1), NOT grain yield. Flash carbonization ~430C (high VM) and ~650C (low VM). Data from Figs 1-3. Charcoal generally DECREASED growth on fertile Andisol due to N immobilization, but effects varied on infertile Ultisol.",
